    <briefdescription>
<para>AES-128 cipher engine (ECB &amp; CBC mode with PKCS#7 padding). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Constant-time, zero-heap implementation designed for embedded systems. Supports 128-bit key expansion and CBC cipher block chaining. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
